WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:08.184
Cora and Mo took off.

2
00:00:08.185 --> 00:00:10.424
Cora went one way.

3
00:00:10.425 --> 00:00:13.086
Mo went the other way.

4
00:00:13.087 --> 00:00:17.845
They had to find Herbie a new home!

5
00:00:17.846 --> 00:00:23.808
They searched all over.

6
00:00:23.809 --> 00:00:28.345
"It must be the right shape," Cora thought.

7
00:00:28.346 --> 00:00:36.651
"It must be the right size," Mo thought.

8
00:00:36.652 --> 00:00:39.356
Cora got back to Herbie first.

9
00:00:39.357 --> 00:00:42.987
"Here's a nice shell," she said.

10
00:00:42.988 --> 00:00:47.331
"Thanks, Cora."

11
00:00:47.332 --> 00:00:53.591
Herbie tried to get inside the shell.

12
00:00:53.592 --> 00:00:57.179
"It's the right shape," he said.

13
00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:00.456
"But it's too small."

14
00:01:00.457 --> 00:01:04.848
Soon Mo came back. "How about this?"

15
00:01:04.849 --> 00:01:07.452
He set something down.

16
00:01:07.453 --> 00:01:10.304
"It's not a shell," Mo said.

17
00:01:10.305 --> 00:01:12.489
"But it might work."

18
00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.695
"No!" Cora shook her head.

19
00:01:15.696 --> 00:01:20.787
"Plastic bottles are not good homes for crabs."

20
00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:23.692
"What should we do?" Mo said.

21
00:01:23.693 --> 00:01:27.298
"I need a shell," Herbie said.

22
00:01:27.299 --> 00:01:31.824
Cora looked up. "Arrow, can you help?"

23
00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:34.962
The arrow started to spin.

24
00:01:34.963 --> 00:01:38.638
But . . . it just kept spinning!

25
00:01:38.639 --> 00:01:41.457
"Ugh!" Cora said.

26
00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:44.809
"I think the arrow is confused.

27
00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:48.426
There are too many shells in the sea!"

28
00:01:48.427 --> 00:01:52.137
"Please hurry, Cora," Herbie said.

29
00:01:52.138 --> 00:01:56.033
"The stingray is coming closer!"

30
00:01:56.034 --> 00:01:58.297
He gulped.

31
00:01:58.298 --> 00:02:03.460
Then he buried himself deep in the sand!

